# The graph with more than 16 steps: OCT pages the keys (and the step on the knobs) by 16
wait 300
demo 3
tap SEQ
turn SELECT -20
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 150
expect page TRACK
turn K2 16
wait 200
turn SELECT -20
wait 100
turn SELECT 5
wait 150
expect page GRAPH
tap OCT+
wait 150
turn K1 3
wait 200
shot graph_p2.png
tap OCT-
wait 150
expect page GRAPH
